rd", "contents": [{"content": "beurk", "type": "name"}, {"content": "quelque chose qui nous d\u00e9go\u00fbte ; que l'on n'aime pas (informel)", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(interjection)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Je d\u00e9teste les cornichons ! Beurk, comment tu peux manger \u00e7a ?!?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn2le06ob07aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "le cornichon", "type": "name"}, {"content": "petit concombre vinaigr\u00e9", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom m.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Pouvez-vous rajouter des cornichons dans ma salade ?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn2le06ob07aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "la choucroute", "type": "name"}, {"content": "plat originaire d'Alsace compos\u00e9e de choux, de viande, de charcuterie et de pommes de terre", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom f.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : La choucroute est mon plat pr\u00e9f\u00e9r\u00e9.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn2le06ob07aud08", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "l'\u00e9clair au chocolat", "type": "name"}, {"content": "p\u00e2te \u00e0 choux compos\u00e9e de cr\u00e8me et recouverte de chocolat", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom m.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Est-ce que je peux avoir un \u00e9clair au chocolat, s'il vous pla\u00eet ? ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn2le06ob07aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"content": "frn2le06ob07re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "d\u00e9go\u00fbtant, d\u00e9go\u00fbtante", "type": "name"}, {"content": "qui provoque le d\u00e9go\u00fbt", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjectif m./f.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Beurk, les cornichons sont d\u00e9go\u00fbtants. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn2le06ob07aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "\u00c9crivez un dialogue de 20 \u00e0 30 mots avec votre camarade. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Dans le dialogue, \u00e9crivez sur la nourriture et votre plat pr\u00e9f\u00e9r\u00e9. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Passez une commande. Vous \u00eates le client. Soyez poli. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Quand vous \u00eates le traiteur, montrez que vous \u00eates en train d'\u00e9couter. ", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "J'\u00e9cris un dialogue sur la nourriture que je pr\u00e9f\u00e8re.  ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "J'utilise des sons et des expressions pour montrer que j'\u00e9coute. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Je demande la permission. ", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "servir", "type": "name"}, {"content": "Donner un plat ou une boisson", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verbe)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Bonjour, qu'est-ce que je peux vous servir ?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn2le06ob07aud05", "type": "audio"}]}], "type": "sena", "labs": [{"exercises": [{"id": 0, "template_override": 1, "stimuli_ids": [0], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Listening", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Speaking", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Je peux utiliser des sons et des expressions pour montrer une \u00e9coute active. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "Je peux parler de nourriture.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "Je peux demander la permission. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "Quel est votre plat pr\u00e9f\u00e9r\u00e9&nbsp;?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": "Quels ingr\u00e9dients y a-t-il dans ce plat&nbsp;? ", "type": "Free Header Item"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"conten